{"v":4,"catch":"在太空中開闢一條道路！！\n“Thunder Ceptor”！！","desc":"《THUNDER CEPTOR》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1986 年發行的射擊遊戲。你的任務是通過連接星系的能量走廊安全返回聯邦基地。 本作還收錄了原作作曲家「Norio Nakagata」的新樂譜。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-06-30","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/82b75199729d08c12e528b05db3ab38e34fdd9cfab671a375258b85e01254f38.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/730c5855c638f037d43fd9d972bc0aaa648961e3fd80366b6b6b9c0db7a9f985.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e56f0c9ddea96fe2eff6b8ed2af7a0a6b3c8bb008377f3c0f7ed584e93f8af0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a11bab819a51755075977f8d1c8fc19c0a9e095a2ca1edc4570de1cd6081042.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c934f625ba12323719ce21ab8c66b7890d0299f8db9dfd4c1def4b38cdd423d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb183b57dab4418e353d8215c66ace6ddee61f650212c6df3fd3ee7409375cbe.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ef70178d8000","dlc":[]}